      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help. i think someone might be remotely accessing my smart home stuff. my thermostat keeps dropping a few degrees every night around 2am and my hue lights keep shifting to a dim warm amber for like 10 mins before going back to normal. it's too consistent to be a glitch. i think my ex is doing it to mess with me. can you help me figure out how to track if these changes are being triggered by an external login?",
